## 0. Verdict summary

**4 ATTENTION item(s)**:
1. W4 value clipping (round(W/eff) outside [-8,7])
2. W4 weight error above the project's own 15% bound on 5/249 matrices (worst `L8.dn.in_b` 15.47%)
3. y32 headroom: conservative `sh` discards up to 5.6 bits of the int32 accumulator (precision only, no overflow)
4. embedding at Q7.8 uses 0.37% of the int16 range (120 LSB peak, 3.4 LSB RMS) -> 8.4% relative RMS error on the layer-0 residual

